.Dd March 31, 2025
.Dt SET_ADDS 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm set_adds
.Nd add a null-terminated string to a hash set
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In set.h
.Ft int
.Fn set_adds "set_t *set" "const char *str"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Fn set_adds
function inserts the null-terminated string
.Fa str
into the hash set
.Fa set .
.Sh RETURN VALUES
Returns 1 on successful insertion, 2 if already present, or 0 on error.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr set_add 3